    <location value="281"/>
<![CDATA[Crown Prince, Deputy Premier, Minister of Defence & Aviation and Inspector General]]>  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="101"/>
    <location value="299"/>
    <location value="415"/>
    <location value="358"/>
    For their continuous support and gracious consideration, the Saudi Building Code National Committee (SBCNC) is honored to present the first issue of the Saudi Building Code (SBC).
  </text>
  <page_break/>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="110"/>
    <location value="59"/>
    <location value="408"/>
    <location value="72"/>
