    <location value="467"/>
    VAPOR-PERMEABLE MEMBRANE. A material or covering having a permeance rating of  52.9  x  10 -10 kg/Pa.s.m 2 or  greater,  when  tested  in  accordance  with  the  dessicant  method
  </text>
