    <location value="310"/>
    WHEELCHAIR SPACE CLUSTER. See Section 9.2.1.
  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="61"/>
    <location value="324"/>
    <location value="229"/>
    <location value="330"/>
    WIRE BACKING. See Section 10.2.1.
  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="61"/>
    <location value="344"/>
    <location value="229"/>
    <location value="351"/>
    WORKSTATION. See Section 2.27.2.
  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="61"/>
    <location value="365"/>
    <location value="323"/>
    <location value="371"/>
    WYTHE. See Section 2.1 (Referenced Chapter 2 of IBC 305).
  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="61"/>
    <location value="385"/>
    <location value="454"/>
    <location value="400"/>
    YARD. An open space, other than a court, unobstructed from the ground to the sky, except where specifically provided by this code, on the lot on which a building is situated.
  </text>
