  <heading level="2">
    <location value="193"/>
    <location value="432"/>
    <location value="322"/>
    <location value="447"/>
    SECTION 2.7 HIGH-HAZARD GROUP H
  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>2.7.1</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="61"/>
    <location value="457"/>
    <location value="454"/>
    <location value="472"/>
    High-Hazard  Group  H. High-Hazard  Group  H  occupancy  includes,  among others,  the  use  of  a  building  or  structure,  or  a  portion  thereof,  that  involves  the
  </list>
  <page_footer>
    <layer value="furniture"/>
    <location value="61"/>
    <location value="477"/>
    <location value="95"/>
    <location value="482"/>
    SBC 201
  </page_footer>
