    <footnote>
      <location value="60"/>
      <location value="277"/>
      <location value="457"/>
      <location value="288"/>
      b.  Maximum allowable quantities shall be increased 100 percent in buildings that are sprinklered in accordance with Section 7.3.3.1.1. When Note c also applies, the increase for both notes shall be applied accumulatively.
    </footnote>
    <footnote>
      <location value="60"/>
      <location value="290"/>
      <location value="457"/>
