  <text>
    <location value="108"/>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="454"/>
    <location value="82"/>
    Exception :  The  height  of  one-story  aircraft  hangars,  aircraft  paint  hangars  and buildings used for the manufacturing of aircraft shall not be limited if the building is  provided  with  an  automatic  fire-extinguishing  system  in  accordance  with Chapter 7 and is entirely surrounded by public ways or yards not less in width than one and one-half times the height of the building.
  </text>
