  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>d.</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="53"/>
    <location value="438"/>
    <location value="458"/>
    <location value="448"/>
    Horizontal battens. Battens shall be not less than 25 by 50 mm nominal. Provisions shall be made for drainage by a minimum of 3.2 mm riser at each nail or by 4 foot-long battens with at least a 12.7 mm separation between battens. Horizontal battens are required for slopes over 7:12.
    <ldiv>
      <marker>e.</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="53"/>
    <location value="450"/>
    <location value="458"/>
    <location value="459"/>
    Perimeter fastening areas include three tile courses but not less than 900 mm from either side of hips or ridges and edges of eaves and gable rakes.
  </list>
