      <marker>6.7.7.2</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="61"/>
    <location value="385"/>
    <location value="454"/>
    <location value="400"/>
    Deck slope. Slate shingles shall only be used on slopes of four units vertical in 12 units horizontal (4:12) or greater.
    <ldiv>
      <marker>6.7.7.3</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="61"/>
    <location value="402"/>
    <location value="446"/>
    <location value="417"/>
    Underlayment. Underlayment shall comply with ASTM D 226, Type II. Exception: Detached accessory structures that contain no conditioned floor area.
