      TABLE 8.14.1 SPACES WITH ONE MEANS OF EGRESS
    </caption>
    <ched/>
    OCCUPANCY
    <ched/>
    MAXIMUM OCCUPANT LOAD
    <nl/>
    <fcel/>
    A, B, E, F, M, U
    <fcel/>
    50
    <nl/>
