    <content> Either Table 11.15.1 or 11.15.2 shall be appropriate for sloped glass depending on whether the snow or wind load is dominant (see Section 11.15.2). For glass types (vertical or sloped) not included in the tables, refer to ASTM E 1300 for guidance.</content>
