    <location value="138"/>
    <location value="386"/>
    where:
  </text>
  <list>
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="108"/>
    <location value="388"/>
    <location value="454"/>
    <location value="402"/>
    Fg is  the  maximum  load  on  the  skylight  determined  from  Equations  11.15-3 through 11.15-5 in Section 11.15.2.
  </list>
  <text>
    <location value="108"/>
    <location value="404"/>
    <location value="328"/>
    <location value="411"/>
    PG is the performance grade rating of the skylight.
  </text>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>11.16.5.2</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="61"/>
    <location value="413"/>
    <location value="454"/>
    <location value="444"/>
    Unit  skylights  rated  for  separate  performance  grades  for  positive  and negative  design  pressure. The  design  of  unit  skylights  rated  for  performance grade  for  both  positive  and  negative  design  pressures  shall  be  based  on  the following equations:
  </list>
