    <ched/>
    Glazed panels regulated by item 6 of Section 11.17.3 (Category class)
    <ched/>
    Doors and enclosures regulated by item 5 of Section 11.17.3 (Category class)
    <ched/>
    Sliding glass doors patio type (Category class)
