    13.10.6.7 HVAC systems. Evaluate the ability of the HVAC system to resist the movement of  smoke  and  fire  beyond  the  point  of  origin.  Under  the  categories  in  Section 13.9.6.7.1, determine the appropriate value and enter that value into Table 13.10.7 under Safety Parameter 13.10.6.7, HVAC Systems, for fire safety, means of egress and general safety.
