    <ldiv>
      <marker>2.</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="107"/>
    <location value="139"/>
    <location value="451"/>
    <location value="154"/>
    Category b - Fire alarm system with manual fire alarm boxes in accordance with SBC 801 and alarm notification appliances in accordance with SBC 801.
    <ldiv>
      <marker>3.</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="107"/>
    <location value="156"/>
    <location value="378"/>
    <location value="162"/>
    Category c - Fire alarm system in accordance with SBC 801.
    <ldiv>
      <marker>4.</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="107"/>
    <location value="164"/>
    <location value="451"/>
    <location value="204"/>
    Category d - Category c plus a required emergency voice/alarm communications system and a fire command station that conforms to Section 2.16.8  and  contains  the  emergency  voice/alarm  communications  system controls,  fire  department  communication  system  controls  and  any  other controls specified in SBC 801 where those systems are provided.
    <ldiv>
